Automated Load Test Script Generation from Production Traffic

Objective:
Develop a system capable of automatically generating realistic load testing scripts based on production traffic patterns, significantly reducing manual scripting effort.


Key Capabilities:
•	Traffic Data Ingestion:
Collects and analyzes data from: 
o	Application logs 
o	API gateway logs 
o	OpenTelemetry traces 
o	Observability platforms 
•	User Journey Identification:
Applies clustering and behavioral analysis to group requests into realistic user workflows and journeys. 
•	Automatic Script Generation:
Produces executable load testing scripts compatible with tools such as: 
o	JMeter 
o	k6 
o	Gatling 
•	Dynamic Test Data Handling:
Automatically manages: 
o	Correlation of dynamic values 
o	Parameterization of inputs 
o	Simulation of realistic think times and user behavior 

Expected Outcomes:
•	Immediate generation of realistic load test scripts 
•	Significant reduction in manual scripting time and effort 
•	Improved accuracy of performance testing through production-like traffic patterns 

Business Value:
•	Accelerates performance testing setup 
•	Enhances test realism and coverage 
•	Enables faster validation of system scalability and resilience

